ext_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>Une définition et une reformulation signifient la&nbsp;même<br>chose et peuvent être utilisées de manière&nbsp;interchangeable.</p>"},{"id":"exelem_14ffe0c2-bd08-4cfb-adf5-a4f2c1844299","type":"label","metrics":{"x":141,"y":241,"width":0,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":103},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"exelem_40ee1dbe-0831-4ca4-d46d-f96158f48453","type":"label","metrics":{"x":60,"y":220,"width":550,"fixed_width":"550","height":46,"zindex":102},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">Une définition donne un exemple concret, alors qu’une<br>reformulation apporte une preuve.</p>"},{"id":"exelem_cd7f6197-7714-4568-9703-d7a6811ddaa0","type":"label","metrics":{"x":60,"y":120,"width":550,"fixed_width":"550","height":82,"zindex":101},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Unicode MS&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">Une définition donne le sens précis d’un mot ou d’une<br>expression, tandis qu</span>’<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Arial Unicode MS&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\">une reformulation exprime&nbsp;une même<br>idée en mots plus simples.</span></p>"}]},"types":["Cases à cocher"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"11.1.4","displayLabel":"11.1.4 — Dossier 1 - Lire le texte explicatif"},{"id":"114544","name":"M3_expli_D1_notions_05","title":"<p><b>Vrai ou faux? Coche la bonne réponse.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_6c9b1d6a-0e3f-4d11-9ea9-d42959e6be5c","type":"label","metrics":{"x":410,"y":205,"width":38,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":111},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">faux</p>"},{"id":"exelem_81f1ed4c-aeaa-44db-c717-4cd76cffa0bf","type":"label","metrics":{"x":220,"y":205,"width":32,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":110},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"color: #115278; font-family: Arial; font-size: 20px; font-weight: normal;\">vrai</p>"},{"id":"exelem_b265ee33-9763-4d76-b60b-2845fe7cd480","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":170,"y":200,"width":"30","height":"30","zindex":108},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"1"},{"id":"exelem_2d004383-f459-495b-beb5-dceb2b0860e5","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":360,"y":200,"width":"30","height":"30","zindex":106},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"1"},{"id":"exelem_14ffe0c2-bd08-4cfb-adf5-a4f2c1844299","type":"label","metrics":{"x":141,"y":241,"width":0,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":103},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">&nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"exelem_cd7f6197-7714-4568-9703-d7a6811ddaa0","type":"label","metrics":{"x":50,"y":100,"width":550,"fixed_width":"550","height":54,"zindex":101},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p align=\"center\">Toute illustration utilisée dans un texte explicatif<br>correspond à un procédé explicatif.</p>"}]},"types":["Cases à cocher"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"11.1.5","displayLabel":"11.1.5 — Dossier 1 - Lire le texte explicatif"},{"id":"114550","name":"M3_expli_D1_notions_06","title":"<p><b>Indique si les moyens linguistiques en gras introduisent une cause ou une conséquence.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_00011875-8dfb-42a1-c256-fb40e8d033b6","type":"dropdown_menu","metrics":{"x":494,"y":273,"width":"128","height":"32","zindex":106},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"selected_index":-1,"options":["cause","conséquence"],"menu_position":"bottom"},{"id":"exelem_dab3de04-3054-49a1-f5ab-3b9c61c30952","type":"label","metrics":{"x":22,"y":278,"width":450,"fixed_width":"450","height":109,"zindex":105},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>c) <b>Puisque</b>&nbsp;les plantes absorbent le dioxyde de<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;carbone et libèrent de l’oxygène, elles jouent un<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;rôle essentiel dans l’équilibre de l’atmosphère et<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;la survie de nombreux êtres vivants.&nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"exelem_c08f9e9f-421f-448a-c3d7-8be6451e43ba","type":"dropdown_menu","metrics":{"x":493,"y":187,"width":"128","height":"32","zindex":104},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"selected_index":-1,"options":["cause","conséquence"],"menu_position":"bottom"},{"id":"exelem_6a26d27c-6b01-41cd-bdb4-94e707f63eb0","type":"label","metrics":{"x":24,"y":187,"width":450,"fixed_width":"450","height":82,"zindex":103},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>b) Lorsqu’il pleut et que la température chute<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;soudainement,&nbsp;<b>cela entraine</b>&nbsp;la formation de<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;verglas.</p>"},{"id":"exelem_022bf654-6837-476e-a57c-3122586d993b","type":"dropdown_menu","metrics":{"x":494,"y":115,"width":"128","height":"32","zindex":102},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"selected_index":-1,"options":["cause","conséquence"],"menu_position":"bottom"},{"id":"exelem_61714cae-a5a9-4f5e-e11e-16dec049f7a3","type":"label","metrics":{"x":23,"y":118,"width":450,"fixed_width":"450","height":54,"zindex":101},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>a) La déforestation massive&nbsp;<b>engendre</b>&nbsp;l’érosion<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; des sols et la perte de biodiversité.</p>"}]},"types":["Menus"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"11.1.6","displayLabel":"11.1.6 — Dossier 1 - Lire le texte explicatif"},{"id":"114552","name":"M3_expli_D1_notions_07","title":"<p><b>Indique si les moyens linguistiques en gras introduisent une cause ou une conséquence.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_00011875-8dfb-42a1-c256-fb40e8d033b6","type":"dropdown_menu","metrics":{"x":491,"y":258,"width":"128","height":"32","zindex":106},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"selected_index":-1,"options":["cause","conséquence"],"menu_position":"bottom"},{"id":"exelem_6a26d27c-6b01-41cd-bdb4-94e707f63eb0","type":"label","metrics":{"x":23,"y":258,"width":450,"fixed_width":"450","height":82,"zindex":103},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>b) La prolifération d’espèces exotiques&nbsp;<b>peut<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;provoquer</b>&nbsp;le déclin, voire la disparition, des<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;espèces locales.&nbsp;</p>"},{"id":"exelem_022bf654-6837-476e-a57c-3122586d993b","type":"dropdown_menu","metrics":{"x":494,"y":117,"width":"128","height":"32","zindex":102},"text_format":{"font":"Arial Unicode MS","color":"#115278","size":20,"align":"center","html":true,"latex":false},"input_styles":{"color":"default","border_width":"md"},"selected_index":-1,"options":["cause","conséquence"],"menu_position":"bottom"},{"id":"exelem_61714cae-a5a9-4f5e-e11e-16dec049f7a3","type":"label","metrics":{"x":23,"y":118,"width":450,"fixed_width":"450","height":109,"zindex":101},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>a) <b>Parce qu’</b>elles n’ont pas de prédateurs<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;naturels, les espèces exotiques se multiplient<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;vite lorsqu’elles sont introduites dans un nouvel<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;écosystème.</p>"}]},"types":["Menus"],"theory":"","explanation":"","number":"11.1.7","displayLabel":"11.1.7 — Dossier 1 - Lire le texte explicatif"},{"id":"114553","name":"M3_expli_D1_notions_08","title":"<p><b>Coche le mode d’organisation dans lequels cet extrait s’inscrit.</b></p>","canvas":{"width":650,"height":400,"elements":[{"id":"exelem_8f5fa22c-26cc-478d-8743-66e0f28cc09c","type":"label","metrics":{"x":100,"y":319,"width":192,"fixed_width":"","height":23,"zindex":111},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p style=\"font-family: Arial;\">b) Addition de causes</p>"},{"id":"exelem_44ffd810-cac6-4841-96a9-89f4adfa5151","type":"label","metrics":{"x":44,"y":96,"width":550,"fixed_width":"550","height":136,"zindex":110},"text_format":{"font":"Arial","color":"#115278","size":22,"align":"left","html":true,"latex":false},"text":"<p>En raison de l’augmentation des gaz à effet de serre dans l’atmosphère, la température moyenne de la planète s’élève progressivement, entrainant des phénomènes météorologiques extrêmes plus fréquents et une élévation du niveau des mers.</p>"},{"id":"exelem_77d8e608-a7b5-48b2-e8bd-6afe91d5ba3e","type":"checkbox","metrics":{"x":58,"y":313,"width":"30","height":"30","zindex":108},"checkbox_styles":{"border_width":"md","color":"default"},"checked":false,"group":"1"},{"id":"exelem_1e0e425c-f2fc-